                "text": "Rep. Roy: \u201cThe current situation with respect to healthcare exists entirely by record of vote and record of policies, as a result of my Democrat colleagues putting forward the policies that the American people are having to live under. They broke the [healthcare] system\u2026\n\nWhat my Democratic colleagues are proposing is an insurance company enrichment scheme. Literally what they're doing is printing money in the treasury and giving it to insurance companies. \n\nThat's their solution for healthcare \u2014 enriching insurance companies,\u201d",
