                "text": "Rep. Roy to @MariaBartiromo on healthcare: \"Democrats have been saying we need to give more money to insurance companies. President Trump as usual is completely correct... Let's give support to American families and hard working Americans who can't afford health care. \n\nThe average family of four having to spend $25,000 between themselves and their employer to get subpar care, have no access to the doctors of their choice, have fewer options, and spending more money. \n\nWe need to give a freedom of options for the average hard working American family so you can be able to go to the doctor of your choice, rather than enriching insurance companies, which is what Democrats want to do. We need to follow the president and back him up.\"",
